@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 13.6 Account Emails - class diagram
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam wrapWidth 240
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 50
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #444444
  BackgroundColor<<View>> #EADCFF
  BackgroundColor<<Controller>> #D8F3DC
  BackgroundColor<<Service>> #DCECFF
  BackgroundColor<<Repository>> #FFF1C9
  BackgroundColor<<Entity>> #E0F3E7
  BackgroundColor<<External>> #FFE0E0
  BackgroundColor<<DTO>> #ECECEC
  BackgroundColor<<Scheduler>> #FFE8CC
}
hide empty members
hide circle

class View <<View>>

class AuthController <<Controller>> {
  register(request): 202 MessageResponse
  registerShop(request): 202 MessageResponse
  verifyEmail(request): 200 MessageResponse
  resendVerification(request): 202 MessageResponse
  forgotPassword(request): 202 MessageResponse
  resetPassword(request): 200 MessageResponse
}
class AuthService <<Service>> {
  registerCustomer(request)
  registerShop(request)
  resend(email, captchaId, captchaAnswer)
  verify(email, code, captchaId, captchaAnswer)
}
class OtpService <<Service>> {
  forgotPassword(email, captchaId, captchaAnswer)
  resetPassword(email, code, password, confirmation, captchaId, captchaAnswer)
  -issue(userId, purpose, captchaId, captchaAnswer)
  -eligible(user, purpose): boolean
}
class StaffApplicationController <<Controller>> {
  apply(shopId, user, body): 200 Result
  decide(shopId, id, user, body): 200 Result
}
class StaffApplicationService <<Service>> {
  apply(shopId, actor, input): Result
  decide(shopId, id, actor, approve): Result
}
class StaffInvitationController <<Controller>> {
  send(id, user, body): 202 InvitationResponse
}
class StaffInvitationService <<Service>> {
  send(shopId, actor, email): InvitationResponse
}
class AuthMailEvent <<DTO>> {
  userId
  email
  kind: Kind
  code
}
class VerificationMailSender <<Service>> {
  send(event) : AFTER_COMMIT
  sendOtp(event) : BEFORE_COMMIT
  -isOtp(event): boolean
  -deliver(event)
}
class UserRepository <<Repository>> {
  existsByEmail(email): boolean
  findByEmail(email): Optional<User>
  findUserIdByEmail(email): Optional<String>
  findByIdForUpdate(id): Optional<User>
}
class User <<Entity>> {
  id
  email
  fullName
  isEmailVerified
  status
  role
}
class "SMTP server" as SMTP <<External>>

View --> AuthController : POST /api/auth/register\nPOST /api/auth/register-shop\nPOST /api/auth/verify-email\nPOST /api/auth/resend-verification\nPOST /api/auth/forgot-password\nPOST /api/auth/reset-password
View --> StaffApplicationController : POST /api/customer/shops/{shopId}/applications\nPUT /api/shop/mine/{shopId}/applications/{id}
View --> StaffInvitationController : POST /api/shop/mine/{id}/invitations
AuthController --> AuthService : register, resend, verify
AuthController --> OtpService : forgot password, reset password
StaffApplicationController --> StaffApplicationService
StaffInvitationController --> StaffInvitationService
AuthService --> UserRepository
OtpService --> UserRepository
StaffApplicationService --> UserRepository
StaffInvitationService --> UserRepository
AuthService ..> AuthMailEvent : publishes REGISTER_OTP, WELCOME
OtpService ..> AuthMailEvent : publishes RESET_OTP, PASSWORD_CHANGED
StaffApplicationService ..> AuthMailEvent : publishes STAFF_APPLICATION_NEW / APPROVED / REJECTED
StaffInvitationService ..> AuthMailEvent : publishes STAFF_INVITATION
VerificationMailSender ..> AuthMailEvent : listens
VerificationMailSender --> SMTP : plain text via JavaMailSender
UserRepository ..> User

note bottom of AuthMailEvent
  Kind: REGISTER_OTP, RESET_OTP, WELCOME, PASSWORD_CHANGED, STAFF_INVITATION,
  STAFF_APPLICATION_NEW, STAFF_APPLICATION_APPROVED, STAFF_APPLICATION_REJECTED.
  Published through Spring ApplicationEventPublisher; toString() prints "[redacted]",
  so OTP codes and invitation tokens never reach the logs.
end note

note bottom of VerificationMailSender
  OTP kinds (REGISTER_OTP, RESET_OTP) are sent BEFORE_COMMIT. SMTP failure throws 503
  "Chưa gửi được email OTP. Vui lòng thử lại sau; nếu vẫn lỗi, liên hệ quản trị kiểm tra cấu hình gửi mail."
  and the transaction is rolled back.
  Other kinds are sent AFTER_COMMIT. An SMTP failure is only logged ("Auth email delivery failed ...")
  and not retried; the account change stays.
  Mails are plain text (SimpleMailMessage), not HtmlMailSender. Subjects start with "FlowerShop - ".
end note

note bottom of OtpService
  Silent skips (202, same message for every case, nothing stored, nothing sent):
  - email unknown, or account not ACTIVE;
  - reset requested for an account that is not verified or has no password.
  Register OTP (AuthService) is different: an existing account gives 409 "Email đã được đăng ký.".
  After a successful reset, PASSWORD_CHANGED is published; all sessions are revoked.
end note

note bottom of StaffInvitationService
  Mail link: frontendBaseUrl/invitations/accept?code=<invitationId>.<token>&email=<invitee>. Valid 24 h.
  No skip rule for an unverified address: the invitee may not have an account yet.
  Before the mail: 400 if an existing account is not ACTIVE or not CUSTOMER / SHOP_STAFF,
  409 if already linked to the shop, 429 "Chờ ít nhất 60 giây; tối đa 3 thư/email và 20 email/shop trong một giờ.".
end note

note bottom of StaffApplicationService
  Apply and approve need a CUSTOMER account that is ACTIVE and email-verified (409 otherwise).
  Mails go to the stored address (owner for NEW, applicant for APPROVED / REJECTED); no verified-email check before sending.
  Approval sets the role to SHOP_STAFF and revokes the applicant's sessions.
end note

@enduml
